{"lines": ["Ten people vanished from a ship, and the ship kept sailing without them.", "December, eighteen seventy-two. A passing crew finds the Mary Celeste drifting off the Azores.", "They climb aboard. No one answers.", "Six months of food. Over seventeen hundred barrels of alcohol, almost all intact. Everyone's belongings, untouched.", "Only the small lifeboat is gone, with the captain's instruments.", "But the last log entry is nine days old, written off an island nearly four hundred miles away.", "Captain Briggs had his wife and two-year-old daughter aboard. Why leave a ship that still floated?", "In Gibraltar, officials suspected murder: stains on a rail, cuts on the bow.", "Then the tests came back. The stains were not blood.", "One pump lay taken apart on deck, with three and a half feet of water in the hold.", "Some think a jammed pump made Briggs fear sinking. Others, that alcohol fumes made him fear an explosion.", "Fear of sinking, or fear of fire: which made them leave the ship?"], "words": [["Ten", 0.0, 0.14], ["people", 0.14, 0.44], ["vanished", 0.44, 0.76], ["from", 0.76, 1.16], ["a", 1.16, 1.24], ["ship,", 1.24, 1.48], ["and", 1.74, 1.92], ["the", 1.92, 2.0], ["ship", 2.0, 2.22], ["kept", 2.22, 2.44], ["sailing", 2.44, 2.86], ["without", 2.86, 3.26], ["them.", 3.26, 3.62], ["December,", 3.98, 4.196], ["eighteen", 4.196, 4.8], ["seventy-two.", 4.8, 5.556], ["A", 5.916, 6.036], ["passing", 6.036, 6.396], ["crew", 6.396, 6.716], ["finds", 6.716, 7.276], ["the", 7.276, 7.496], ["Mary", 7.496, 7.756], ["Celeste", 7.756, 8.236], ["drifting", 8.236, 8.736], ["off", 8.736, 9.196], ["the", 9.196, 9.356], ["Azores.", 9.356, 9.816], ["They", 10.176, 10.235], ["climb", 10.235, 10.495], ["aboard.", 10.495, 10.815], ["No", 11.175, 11.375], ["one", 11.375, 11.595], ["answers.", 11.595, 11.975], ["Six", 12.335, 12.497], ["months", 12.497, 12.777], ["of", 12.777, 12.997], ["food.", 12.997, 13.277], ["Over", 13.637, 13.757], ["seventeen", 13.757, 14.038], ["hundred"